# API Documentation — Document Intelligence Core (AU DIC)
## REST API Reference — Version 1.0.0

Base URL: `http://localhost:5000/api/document-intelligence`  
Authentication: `Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>` (Header: `Authorization`)  
Tenant Scope: Enforced via `organizationId` from authenticated user context.

---

## Endpoint Summary

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Scope |
|---|---|---|---|
| `POST` | `/documents` | Upload & initiate document extraction pipeline | `STUDENT`, `FACULTY`, `ADMIN` |
| `GET` | `/documents` | List uploaded documents with pagination & filter | Tenant-scoped |
| `GET` | `/documents/:id` | Retrieve document details & extracted knowledge records | Tenant-scoped |
| `POST` | `/review/:id` | Submit HITL review (approve / edit / reject fields) | `FACULTY`, `ADMIN` |
| `DELETE` | `/documents/:id` | Soft delete document, knowledge record & history | `ADMIN` / Owner |

---

## Endpoint Details

### 1. Upload & Process Document

`POST /api/document-intelligence/documents`

**Headers**:
```http
Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
```

**Form Data Parameters**:
- `file` (File, required): PDF or Image (JPEG, PNG, WEBP). Max 10MB.
- `category` (String, optional): `CERTIFICATE`, `MARKSHEET`, `TIMETABLE`, `STUDENT_ID`. Auto-detected if omitted.

**Response (`201 Created`)**:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "documentId": "65b2f8a910c2e40012a9b123",
    "filename": "SYNTH_CERT_001.pdf",
    "category": "CERTIFICATE",
    "status": "PENDING_REVIEW",
    "primaryProvider": "Gemini 2.5 Flash",
    "fallbackTriggered": false,
    "extractedFields": {
      "studentName": "Tanya Verma",
      "rollNumber": "2021329554",
      "semester": "Semester 1",
      "sgpa": 8.0,
      "cgpa": 7.97,
      "issueDate": "2023-04-20"
    },
    "latencyMs": {
      "uploadMs": 120,
      "aiInferenceMs": 980,
      "dbStagingMs": 45,
      "totalPipelineMs": 1145
    }
  }
}
```

