### 2. Submit HITL Review

`POST /api/document-intelligence/review/:id`

**Request Body**:
```json
{
  "action": "APPROVED",
  "correctedFields": [
    {
      "fieldName": "rollNumber",
      "correctedValue": "2021329554"
    }
  ],
  "reviewDurationSec": 7.0
}
```

**Response (`200 OK`)**:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "HITL review recorded and knowledge record canonicalized successfully",
  "data": {
    "documentId": "65b2f8a910c2e40012a9b123",
    "reviewStatus": "APPROVED",
    "canonicalStatus": "COMMITTED"
  }
}
```

---

### 3. Transaction-Safe Soft Delete

`DELETE /api/document-intelligence/documents/:id`

**Response (`200 OK`)**:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Document and associated workflow records soft deleted atomically",
  "data": {
    "documentId": "65b2f8a910c2e40012a9b123",
    "recordsDeleted": {
      "uaipUpload": 1,
      "knowledgeRecords": 1,
      "reviewHistory": 1
    },
    "transactionMode": "ACID_SESSION"
  }
}
```
